WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.980
Quick question, would you walk into court with
the other side's lawyer?

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:03.840
No?

00:00:04.280 --> 00:00:06.860
Then why sign a lease with only the landlord's
agent in the room?

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:10.940
At Your Office Space, our tenant representation
team works only for you.

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:12.180
Never the landlord.

00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:15.040
Because the rent on the listing is only part of
the deal.

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:17.000
There are three costs to put on the table.

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:17.960
Your money.

00:00:18.420 --> 00:00:21.860
Rent, outgoings, reviews, incentives and the
cost of leaving.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:23.380
Your time.

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:27.680
Every call, inspection and proposal comes out of
the people running your business.

00:00:27.680 --> 00:00:32.040
And your risk, make-good wording and option
deadlines that can catch you out later.

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:35.360
Here's how we handle all three in five steps.

00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:37.760
One, a free Lease Health Check.

00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:40.020
Two, we agree a written brief.

00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:44.820
Three, we search, inspect and compare the full
cost side by side.

00:00:45.340 --> 00:00:48.240
Four, we negotiate alongside your solicitor.

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:51.460
Five, you decide and we help you settle in.

00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:53.660
More clarity, more time for your business.

00:00:54.280 --> 00:00:55.740
Start with a free Lease Health Check.
